+            "# SpecMesh\n\n## Why\nProvide continuity.\n\n## User Intent\nIndependent continuity.\n\n"
+            "## Constraints\n- Spec is normative.\n- No daemon.\n\n## Non-goals\nNo ops.\n",
+            encoding="utf-8",
+        )
+        (self.root / "docs").mkdir()
